window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A lost city. A forgotten prophecy. A kingdom on the brink of war.</p> <p>When young knight William Carelock discovers a mysterious stone that speaks to him, he is thrust into a battle far greater than he ever imagined. The Oracle Stone is no ordinary relic—it is the key to a long-buried power, a force that could change the fate of the world. But William is not the only one seeking it. The ruthless Empress Telgress will stop at nothing to claim the Deep Magic for herself, and her armies are already marching.</p> <p>Pursued by assassins, warlords, and an empire bent on domination, William must decipher the stone’s secrets before it falls into the wrong hands. With the help of a wise but secretive mage, a silent and deadly ranger, and a battle-hardened warrior, William embarks on a perilous journey through treacherous lands—where magic is feared, alliances are fragile, and betrayal lurks in every shadow. The Oracle Stone calls to him. But will unlocking its power save the world—or doom it?</p>"; 
